{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1578","id":4065035296,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87yS4Qg","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1578","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1578.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1578.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1578","number":1578,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[V1][P0][REL-01] Add thin-V1 deployment and readiness profiles","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- add a checked-in environment matrix for `thin_v1`, `full_rag`, `local`, and `test`\n- make `thin_v1` require only server-owned DB/auth/runtime dependencies while forbidding browser Supabase and provider/RAG filler credentials\n- keep `/api/health` as liveness and add profile-aware `/api/readiness` checks for DB/read projections, enabled Storage, shared rate-limit projection, latency, and observed degraded state\n- replace implicit multi-instance memory fallback with explicit `fail_closed` or `degraded_memory` policy and tests\n- add an operator runbook plus a redacted client-bundle secret scan\n\nTracks #1567\nParent: #1563\n\n## Why\n\nThe existing deployment preflight represented the full RAG/browser-Supabase stack as the only production shape, so a thin V1 could pass only by supplying unrelated credentials. The existing health endpoint was static, and shared rate limiting silently fell back to process-local memory unless operators explicitly disabled degradation.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/deploy/__tests__/preflight-env.test.js api/__tests__/deployment-readiness.test.js api/__tests__/shared-rate-limit.test.js api/__tests__/api-route-integration.test.js` — 4 suites, 30 tests passed\n- direct ESLint over all changed JS/MJS files — passed\n- `DEPLOYMENT_PROFILE=thin_v1 npm run build` — passed\n- `npm run deploy:secret-scan` — 4 assets scanned, 0 findings\n- `npm run quality:report-index` — passed\n- `git diff --check` — passed\n\n## Dependency and rehearsal hold\n\nThe final production-like login-to-learning rehearsal has **not** been run. It must wait until API-01 PR #1569 and AUTH-01 PR #1571 are both merged and read back from `origin/main`. At PR creation time both dependencies remain open/unmerged.\n\nAfter those dependencies land, the rehearsal must use a local/disposable target and remain read-only with respect to remote services. This Draft PR does not claim production deployment or release readiness.\n\n## Boundaries\n\nThis work is outside Campaign A #1550 and does not alter its child list or policy. No remote Supabase, Storage, Vector, or RAG writes were performed; no PDFs were uploaded; no `question_bank` import or public display was introduced; no provider/VLM calls were made; and no source, rights, acceptance, or release state was mutated.","created_at":"2026-07-16T01:40:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T02:46:35Z","closed_at":"2026-07-16T02:46:35Z","merged_at":"2026-07-16T02:46:35Z","merge_